vdr-skin-anthra-sd packaging
============================

The anthra skins by Tomas Saxer (http://www.anthra.de/anthra-skins/) are
packaged here for Debian. Upstream only provides tarballs, the repository
follows the git-buildpackage layout:

  debian/trixie   upstream source with the Debian packaging
  upstream        the imported upstream tarballs
  pristine-tar    data to recreate the orig tarballs

The skin is not built at package build time. vdr-skin-anthra-update from
https://github.com/unf/vdr-skin-anthra-common builds it on the VDR from
the sources in /usr/share/vdr-skin-anthra/SKIN and the options in
/etc/vdr/anthra/SKIN.conf. Changes to the skin go into the XML templates
(xml*/) as patches in debian/patches, the prebuilt .skin of the tarball
is not installed.

Build with git-buildpackage:

  gbp clone https://github.com/unf/vdr-skin-anthra-sd.git
  cd vdr-skin-anthra-sd
  gbp buildpackage

 -- Frank Neumann <fnu@vdr-portal.de>
